#ASSERT `is the instrument an enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council` FALSE
-- B02  V1 src:5: regulations (rules, bye-laws, a scheme) made in Jersey under a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council
#ASSERT `is the instrument an enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `regulations, an Order, rules, bye-laws, a scheme or other instrument passed or made in Jersey under a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council` FALSE
-- B03  V1 src:5: an Order made in Jersey under the authority of an Order in Council
#ASSERT `is the instrument an enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `regulations, an Order, rules, bye-laws, a scheme or other instrument passed or made in Jersey under the authority of an Order in Council` FALSE
-- B06-B08  V1 src:5 ("shall mean"): a Law not confirmed in Council, an instrument made outside Jersey, an instrument made in Jersey under no Law and no Order in Council: none is an enactment (closed)
#ASSERT `is the instrument an enactment` (YMD 2020 6 1) `something that is none of these` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- B09  V2d src:5
#ASSERT `is the instrument an enactment` (YMD 2024 6 1) `a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council` FALSE
