§ `H. Article 3 and the Schedule definition of person`

-- H01  V1 src:18: an enactment relating to a punishable offence, a company, no contrary intention: person includes it, by Article 3 and by the Schedule
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2020 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`
-- H02-H03  V1 src:18 and src:111: an enactment NOT relating to a punishable offence: Article 3 is not engaged, the Schedule definition (V1 src:111, via Art 4(1) V1 src:21) still includes a body corporate
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE (YMD 2020 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by the Schedule only`
-- H04-H05  V1 src:18, src:111: an unincorporated body in an offence enactment: Article 3 says "a body corporate" only; the Schedule says "corporate or unincorporated"
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a body of persons that is unincorporated` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2020 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by the Schedule only`
-- H06  V1 src:18 "unless the contrary intention appears"
#ASSERT REFUSED `does person include this body` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a body corporate` TRUE TRUE (YMD 2020 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only`
