#ASSERT NOT (`does person include this body` (YMD 2026 10 28) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 1954 8 20) FALSE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`)
#ASSERT NOT (`does person include this body` (YMD 2026 10 28) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 1954 8 20) FALSE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 only`)
-- H08  V1 src:19: act 1954-08-21, the day of commencement (Table of Legislation History, V1 src:142): not "before the date of the commencement", so Article 3 applies
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2026 10 28) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 1954 8 21) FALSE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`
-- H09  act 1954-08-22
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2026 10 28) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 1954 8 22) FALSE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`
-- H10  act 1950-01-01 by a body that WOULD have been liable before 21 Aug 1954: the proviso does not bite
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2026 10 28) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 1950 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`
-- H07b  the same pre-1954 act, question asked on a day in V1 (2020): the answer does not depend on which of the seven texts is read
#ASSERT NOT (`does person include this body` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 1954 8 20) FALSE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`)
-- H11  V2f src:18
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2026 10 1) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`
-- H01b  the same answer on either side of 28 Sep 2021 (Article 3 is the same text in all seven versions)
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2021 9 27) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2021 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`
#ASSERT `does person include this body` (YMD 2021 9 28) `a body corporate` TRUE FALSE (YMD 2021 1 1) TRUE `the proviso limits Article 3 only` EQUALS `by Article 3 and by the Schedule`
