#ASSERT REFUSED `do the repealed provisions remain in force at the instant` (YMD 2021 10 1) TRUE (`UTC moment` 2021 10 1 12 0 0) NOTHING
#ASSERT REFUSED `does the repeal of an amended enactment include the repeal of its amendments` (YMD 2021 10 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE
