§ `MD. The Schedule definitions of midnight and month`

-- MD02  V1 src:107: "midnight" in relation to a day means the last moment of that day: 23:59:59 on 2020-06-05 is by midnight on 2020-06-05
#ASSERT (`was the thing done by midnight on the day` (YMD 2020 6 5) (`local moment` (YMD 2020 6 5) 23 59 59))'s `the answer`
-- MD03  00:00:00 on 2020-06-06 is after the midnight of 2020-06-05
#ASSERT (`was the thing done by midnight on the day` (YMD 2020 6 5) (`local moment` (YMD 2020 6 6) 0 0 0))'s `the answer` EQUALS FALSE
-- MD04  00:00:00 on 2020-06-05 is by midnight on 2020-06-05
#ASSERT (`was the thing done by midnight on the day` (YMD 2020 6 5) (`local moment` (YMD 2020 6 5) 0 0 0))'s `the answer`
