#ASSERT (`was the thing done by midnight on the day` (YMD 2018 12 31) (`local moment` (YMD 2019 1 1) 0 0 0))'s `the answer` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT (`was the thing done by midnight on the day` (YMD 2003 3 28) (`local moment` (YMD 2003 3 28) 12 0 0))'s `the basis` EQUALS `inferred from the endnotes of the 2019 consolidation, not verified against L.16/2003`
