-- MD09  the V1 basis for a day in V1
#ASSERT (`was the thing done by midnight on the day` (YMD 2020 6 5) (`local moment` (YMD 2020 6 5) 12 0 0))'s `the basis` EQUALS `read from the deposited text in force on that day`
